{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37391","headline":"夏日访友 · 唐彦谦","name":"夏日访友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[堤]树生昼凉，浓阴扑空翠。\n孤舟唤野渡，村疃入幽邃。\n高轩俯清流，一犬隔花吠。\n童子立门墙，问我向何处？\n主人闻故旧，出迎时倒屣。\n惊迓叙间阔，屈指越寒暑。\n殷勤爲延欵，偶尔得良会。\n春盘擘紫虾，冰鲤斫银鱠。\n荷梗白玉香，荇菜青丝脆。\n腊酒击泥封，罗列总新味。\n移席临湖滨，对此有佳趣。\n流连送深杯，宾主共忘醉。\n清风岸乌纱，长揖谢君去。\n世事如浮云，东西渺烟水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}